sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Player
  participant C as Client (Input, Wield, Fx)
  participant S as Server (Remotes, Combat, Mine)
  participant A as All clients
  P->>C: click (or tap SWING)
  C->>C: play the swing locally, buffer 8 f
  C->>S: Attack intent, a flat aim direction
  S->>S: token bucket per player per remote
  S->>S: unitXZ: reject NaN, huge or zero vectors
  S->>S: move phase, range, arc, cooldown checks
  S->>S: hit: damage, crit x2, hit-stop 4 f or 6 f on a kill
  S-->>A: Event: hit, number, stagger, ore pop
  S-->>A: Snapshot (unreliable): positions
  A->>A: flash, sound, particles, damage number
